{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":38,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["希西迦患病"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那些日子，希西迦病危，亚摩斯的儿子以赛亚先知前来对他说：“耶和华说，‘你要交待后事，因为你要死了，你必无法康复。’”"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["希西迦把脸转向墙，向耶和华祷告，说："]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["“耶和华啊，求你顾念我怎样全心、忠诚地事奉你，做你视为善的事。”希西迦痛哭起来。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["耶和华对以赛亚说："]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["“你去告诉希西迦，‘你祖先大卫的上帝耶和华说，我垂听了你的祷告，也看见了你的眼泪，我要使你的寿命增加十五年。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["我要从亚述王手中拯救你和这城，我要保护这城。’”"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["以赛亚说：“拿一块无花果饼贴在王的疮上，他就会痊愈。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["希西迦问：“有什么兆头证明我会上耶和华的殿呢？”",{"noteId":18}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["以赛亚说：“耶和华要给你一个预兆，以证明祂言出必行。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["祂要使亚哈斯日晷上的日影后退十度。”果然，日影后退了十度。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["犹大王希西迦病愈后，",{"text":"写了一首诗：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“我以为自己盛年之际，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就要踏入阴间之门，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不能享受余年。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我以为再也见不到耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在世间再不能见到祂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不能再见到世人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的居所像牧人的帐篷一样被拆走，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我像织布的卷布一样卷起自己的生命，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂从织布机上把我剪断。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"旦夕之间，祂使我的生命戛然而止。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我整夜哀号，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂像狮子一样咬断我全身的骨头。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"旦夕之间，祂使我的生命戛然而止。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"“我像燕、鹤一样哀鸣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像鸽子一样呻吟；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我举目望天，双眼疲倦。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我困苦不堪，求你保护我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我能说什么呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂对我说的，祂都亲自成就了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为心灵的苦痛，我要一生谨慎行事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"“主啊，你的法令使人存活，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我的心灵存活。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主啊，求你使我身体复原，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"让我存活。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其实我受大苦对我有益。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你施慈爱，从死亡的深坑中拯救我的生命，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"将我一切罪恶抛在你背后。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"诚然，阴间不会称谢你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"死亡不会赞美你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"下坟墓的人不会仰望你的信实。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只有活着的人会像我今天这样称谢你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"父亲会把你的信实告诉子女。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"“耶和华必救我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们要一生一世在祂殿中弹琴歌唱。”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":18,"caller":"+","text":"这两节在原文抄本是放在本章末尾，不过这可能是在誊抄过程中放错位置。其实这两节经文放在6节和7节之间最为自然，就如在列王纪下一样，参见列王纪下20:7‑8。","reference":{"chapter":38,"verse":22}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/38.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/39.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/37.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}